<section class="section-wrap section-space" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM “WHERE DO I START?” TO “SOLD.”</p><h2>You don't have to<br />figure it all out alone.</h2></div><p>A personal plan that meets you where you are.<br />And a guide that makes the next step clearer.</p></div><div class="three-grid steps"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Tell us about your home.</h3><p>A few details help your guide understand your property, your timeline, and what makes your sale unique.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Get a plan that fits.</h3><p>See the tasks and Texas documents that may apply to your home, organized into a manageable journey.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Take the next step, together.</h3><p>Prepare your listing, understand the paperwork, and keep moving toward closing with everything in one place.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="feature-band"><div class="section-wrap two-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE THAN A PLACE TO LIST</p><h2>Your home sale.<br />All in one place.</h2><p>Less searching through emails. More knowing where things stand. Your agent connects your questions, documents, and to-do list.</p><a class="text-link" href="/app/documents">Take a look inside →</a><ul class="feature-list"><li>Property-specific document checklist</li><li>A listing you can make your own</li><li>A clear path from preparation to closing</li></ul></div><div class="preview-card"><div class="guide-heading"><span class="spark">✳</span><strong>Let's make sense of the paperwork.</strong></div><div class="chat-bubble seller">My home was built in 1972. What do I need?</div><div class="chat-bubble">Federal law requires lead-paint disclosures for most homes built before 1978. Let's check the exemptions, then prepare your disclosure and EPA pamphlet before the buyer signs a contract.</div><a class="document-mini" href="/app/documents"><span>▤</span><div><strong>Lead-based paint disclosure</strong><small>Added to your document checklist</small></div><span>↗</span></a><p class="fine-print">A preview of the guided experience. Responses are simulated.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section-wrap section-space pricing-section" id="pricing"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR PRICE. A CLEARER PATH.</p><h2>Your sale, supported.<br />Without the guesswork.</h2><p>Pay for the guidance, organization, and tools that help you move forward. Public home browsing stays free.</p></div><article class="price-card"><span class="pill">THE SELLER PACKAGE</span><div class="price">$299 <small>/ property</small></div><p>12 months of guidance, from your first question to your closing checklist.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Your personal AI selling guide</li><li>Texas document walkthroughs</li><li>Listing tools and a sale roadmap</li><li>One organized seller workspace</li></ul><a class="button light" href="/start">Start my selling plan ↗</a><p class="fine-print">Illustrative launch pricing. No payment is collected. Legal, title, inspection, photography, and MLS services are separate. Official government forms are free.</p></article></section>
<section class="section-wrap faq-section"><p class="eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS</p><h2>A little clarity before you start.</h2><details><summary>Will this replace a lawyer or title company?</summary><p>No. Your guide helps you prepare and stay organized. Qualified professionals handle legal advice, title work, and closing services.</p></details><details><summary>Will my home be on the MLS?</summary><p>MLS syndication is not included in this concept. Public listing and AI discovery tools are separate from any future MLS partner service.</p></details><details><summary>Can buyers find my home through AI apps?</summary><p>We are designing a public listing API and MCP tools for connected applications. Those integrations are previews, not live services yet.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try it without signing up?</summary><p>Yes. Explore a fictional sale, build a sample plan, and edit a draft. No account or payment is required. Demo progress resets when the server restarts.</p></details></section>
